  <h1>ORBOOSH Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 11 October 2026</p>
  <p>ORBOOSH is a bubble-shooter game developed and published by Cymru Pixels.</p>
  <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
  <p>ORBOOSH saves game progress and preferences locally on your device, which may include completed levels, earned stars, scores and settings.</p>
  <h2>Personal information</h2>
  <p>ORBOOSH does not require an account or ask for your name, email address or other personal information to play.</p>
  <h2>Advertising and analytics</h2>
  <p>The current version of ORBOOSH does not include advertising or third-party analytics.</p>
  <h2>Information sharing</h2>
  <p>Cymru Pixels does not intentionally collect or share personal information through the current version of ORBOOSH.</p>
  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>ORBOOSH does not ask children to provide personal information.</p>
  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>Game progress and preferences are stored on your device. Clearing app storage or uninstalling the game may remove this information.</p>
  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>This policy may be updated if ORBOOSH introduces new features, advertising or analytics.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:cymrupixels@gmail.com">cymrupixels@gmail.com</a>.</p>
